The file is a verbatim, vendored snapshot of the MkDocs 1.6 schema published by the
JSON Schema Store project. It is bundled rather than fetched at runtime because a
bundled JSON schema cannot reference a remote schema: the IntelliJ Platform resolves
a relative "$ref" against the parent directory of the schema's own file, so a remote
reference would silently drop the referenced branch.

Refresh the snapshot with:

    ./gradlew refreshMkDocsSchema
